{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not terminally fail workflows for MDC snapshot errors.** An ordinary failure from `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` is routed through `finishFailure` before any plugin or user code runs, producing a durable `FAILED` result for a transient logging-adapter problem. Treat capture as best-effort with guarded cleanup, or propagate a retryable invocation failure instead; update the test that currently expects `FAILED`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc774RlF","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":299,"observation_digest":"2c0c3d2a1a497e758b8e23d8f52310e14fb481614f13f2d2bf375530a2c371cb","observation_id":"aro_v1_fqgd2kq2jf7hlc4oepmpkiyq4f","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:40:07Z","review_id":"arr_v1_dfsghg7x42wurlqw3jtatlfyq7","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"e28732585b856fb3f3117acf4b2d8b5162423d7c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":298,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_nj64awoawca36gbuxrl64vvbgm","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:40:07Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
